    "en": "3. The Income Tax (Approved Banks) (Consolidation) Order (O 32) is amended —\n(a)by deleting the following words in item (11):\n“(a)Swiss Bank Corporation\n30th April 1975.”; and\n(b)by deleting item (28)."
